  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Variable-Angle, 2-Ply Laminator</h2><figure class=\"align-left\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Variable-Angle-2-Ply-Laminator.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>T/P and T/S applications</li>\n<li>0/+θ &amp; 0/-θ Laminates</li>\n<li>On-line metrology</li>\n<li>0.015” (0.4 mm) gap</li>\n<li>Heat staked or heated compaction</li>\n<li>Guillotine &amp; ultrasonic cutters</li>\n<li>25 lbs/hr (11.4 kg/hr)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Cross Ply &amp; Fabric Lamination</h3><ul><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/variable-angle-2-ply-laminator/\">Variable-Angle, 2-Ply Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/flat-panel-fabric-laminator/\">Flat Panel Fabric Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/variable-angle-ply-laminator-i/\">Variable Angle Ply Laminator I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/variable-angle-ply-laminator-ii/\">Variable Angle Ply Laminator II</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Variable-Angle-2-Ply-Laminator.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Variable-Angle-2-Ply-Laminator-300x216.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"216\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
